<title>USA: Hancock Fabrics names Larry Kirk chairman.</title>
<headline>Hancock Fabrics names Larry Kirk chairman.</headline>
<dateline>TUPELO, Miss. 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hancock Fabrics Inc's board elected on Thursday chief executive officer Larry Kirk as chairman.</p>
<p>Kirk replaces Morris Jarvis, who retired from the board, Hancock said in a statement.</p>
<p>Jack Busby Jr was named president and director, replacing Kirk as president. Busby was previously executive vice president of the company.</p>
</text>
